{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T07:39:53+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-11-12T07:39:53+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"KRUK Spólka Akcyjna","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Credit Services","country":"Poland","city":"Wroclaw","website":"https://www.pl.kruk.eu","employees":3175,"summary":"KRUK Spólka Akcyjna, together with its subsidiaries, engages in the management of debt in Poland, Romania, Italy, the Czech Republic, Slovakia, France, Germany, and Spain. The company operates through three segments: Consumer Debts, Mortgage Debts, and Corporate Debts. It offers credit management services, including receivables management services to banks, loan brokers, insurers, leasing companies, landline and mobile telecommunications operators, cable TV operators, digital TV operators, and companies from the FMCG sector. The company also purchases and manages debt portfolios, including consumer, mortgage, and corporate debts. In addition, it offers consumer unsecured, mortgage, and SME/corporate loans. Further, the company provides auxiliary services to small and medium-sized enterprises. Additionally, the company engages in the acquisition and management of real estate properties; purchase of farmland; and IT and software development; and in law firm related activities. KRUK Spólka Akcyjna was founded in 1998 and is headquartered in Wroclaw, Poland.","exchange":"Warsaw","currency":"PLN","financial_currency":"PLN","summary_fr":"KRUK Splka Akcyjna, avec ses filiales, s’occupe de la gestion de la dette en Pologne, en Roumanie, en Italie, en République tchèque, en Slovaquie, en France, en Allemagne et en Espagne. La société opère à travers trois segments: les dettes à la consommation, les dettes hypothécaires et les dettes d'entreprise. Il offre des services de gestion de crédit, y compris des services de gestion des créances aux banques, aux courtiers en prêts, aux assureurs, aux sociétés de crédit-bail, aux opérateurs de télécommunications fixes et mobiles, aux opérateurs de télévision par câble, aux opérateurs de télévision numérique et aux entreprises du secteur des GCFM."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":6560716288,"shares_outstanding":19543390,"trailing_pe":7.2209077,"forward_pe":5.76507,"price_to_book":1.1305505,"ev_to_ebitda":6.694,"ev_to_revenue":5.027,"dividend_yield":0.0596,"payout_ratio":0.4302,"beta_yahoo":0.399},"targets":{"current_price":335.7,"mean":483.71,"median":485.0,"high":585.0,"low":423.0,"n_analysts":5,"reco_mean":1.0,"reco_key":"strong_buy"},"calendar":{"earnings_dates":["2026-10-27"],"eps_avg":null,"eps_low":null,"eps_high":null,"revenue_avg":null,"ex_dividend":"2026-05-29","dividend_date":null},"holders":{"insiders_pct":0.08698,"institutions_pct":0.60997003,"institutions_float_pct":0.66808,"institutions_n":70,"institutions":[],"funds":[{"name":"VANGUARD STAR FUNDS-Vanguard Total International Stock Index Fund","pct":0.013099999,"shares":256141,"value":85986536,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":-0.0113},{"name":"iShares, Inc.-iShares Core MSCI Emerging Markets ETF","pct":0.0109,"shares":212360,"value":71289254,"date":"2026-09-30","chg":-0.00059999997},{"name":"VANGUARD TAX-MANAGED FUNDS-Vanguard Developed Markets Index Fund","pct":0.0088,"shares":172038,"value":57753158,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":0.0175},{"name":"EA Series Trust-Freedom 100 Emerging Markets ETF","pct":0.0069999998,"shares":136343,"value":45770346,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":0.045900002},{"name":"iShares Trust-iShares MSCI Poland ETF","pct":0.0050999997,"shares":99773,"value":33493797,"date":"2026-09-30","chg":0.0552},{"name":"DFA INVESTMENT DIMENSIONS GROUP INC-Emerging Markets Core Eqy. 2 PORT.","pct":0.0047999998,"shares":93438,"value":31367137,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":-0.008},{"name":"VANGUARD Intl Eqy. INDEX Fd.S-Vanguard FTSE All-World ex-US Small-Cap ","pct":0.0034999999,"shares":68887,"value":23125366,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":0.0307},{"